OL,3,GNEWSAMan in life-threatening state
OL,4,Aafter shop robbery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is in a life-threatening
OL,7,Fcondition in hospital after a robbery
OL,8,Fin broad daylight at a jewellery store.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police said six men
OL,11,Fentered Lala Jewellers on Gladstone
OL,12,FStreet in Peterborough at about 11:50
OL,13,FGMT on Saturday.
OL,15,FTwo were wearing white, traditional
OL,16,FPakistani clothing, police said.
OL,18,FShelves were emptied and two employees
OL,19,Fbehind the counter were assaulted,
OL,20,Fbefore the thieves fled in separate
OL,21,Fvehicles.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
